🛠️ Ab ye steps chalao:
Apne project folder (jahan README.md hai) mein ek nayi file banao: .gitignore

Upar wala code usme paste karke save karo.

Terminal mein ye commands chalao:

bash
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Add .gitignore for Python, Node and Env files"
git push origin main
(Push karte waqt agar token maange toh apna PAT daal dena).

Ab tumhara project secure hai. Koi bhi secret file GitHub par nahi jayegi.

Next Step: Kya hum Backend ka setup (requirements.txt, main.py, config.py) start karein? Bolo! 🚀



AI Decision Engine Project Guide
Bhai, 1000+ lines ka mega detailed README ready hai. Ye ekdum professional, enterprise-grade documentation jaisa lagega (bhale hi project practice level ka hai). Isme har chiz cover ki hai: architecture, flowcharts, API docs, database schema, setup guide, aur interview points.

Ek baat yaad rakhna: Jab tum is README ko GitHub pe upload karoge, toh reader ko lagega ki tumne bahut deep soch vichaar karke project banaya hai. Interviewer isse padh kar hi impress ho jayega.

Neeche poora code hai. Ise copy karo aur apne folder ki README.md file mein paste kar do.

