11. Database Design
Tables
Table	Purpose
domains	Master list of 5 domains
strategies	Master list of reasoning strategies
sessions	One row per user request (grouping)
reasoning_requests	User input, chosen domain, chosen strategy
reasoning_steps	Each step of the reasoning trace
final_decisions	Final verdict + confidence score
feedback	Optional user feedback on decisions
Entity Relationships
text
sessions (1) ───< reasoning_requests (1) ───< reasoning_steps
                                  │
                                  └─── (1) final_decisions
                                  │
                                  └─── (1) feedback
Sample reasoning_steps Row
id	request_id	step_num	thought	action	observation	conclusion
1	42	1	Extract inputs	parse	income=50000	Valid
2	42	2	Calc DTI	formula	DTI=4.0	Exceeds limit
